# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# A simulation compiles one program (D[python-simulation-compile]): after
# its creation, runs in several calls of the entry load no module of kernels,
# which they would if a later call compiled a program of its own. The runtime
# traces each load with MDRT_TRACE.
# RUN: env MDRT_TRACE=1 %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_one_program.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide dynamics 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DYNAMICS
# RUN: env MDRT_TRACE=1 %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_one_program.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide minimize 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MINIMIZE
# DYNAMICS: TRACE module
# DYNAMICS: created dynamics
# DYNAMICS-NOT: TRACE module
# DYNAMICS: ran dynamics
# MINIMIZE: TRACE module
# MINIMIZE: created minimize
# MINIMIZE-NOT: TRACE module
# MINIMIZE: ran minimize
